  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "265",
  "tip": "<p>When you see requirements for <i>every change</i> and <i>low latency</i> think event driven triggers on the data store rather than scheduled exports or app originated events. Prefer asynchronous server side capture that fires on committed writes.</p>",
